<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have erupted in the capital Yaounde, the port city Douala and the northern city Maroua, extending fighting between Cameroonian security forces and Ambazonian separatists beyond the Northwest and Southwest regions. The conflict, which began after the 2016‑17 protest suppression, now involves major urban centers previously less affected. The intensity remains high, with 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. This geographic expansion marks a shift from earlier reports that focused on isolated attacks within the Anglophone zones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOM1JLSmlLZEZtblczbzcxaHFVZjR6ZVl6dzdIVmJ0QnlqbV8xa3dVLS1qZmI0N0stSkwxcXhNa0o1M29jYl9IWlloUjBLQVMwc2t4a1gtY1RRWUZJc3ZqLUdkaWVCajEwR3ZZS2pQdG5QYXVvOG11Y0w3VmM1VmhPUXRpc1NuOGp1a3JPdjJUSVlEeElJSDI0T2dGNkRRT1V2Vm9Yam1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hoodline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQR05hRXJsUEJmbDEycloyV3lOdmtVbWltUlp1NF9xeHRCMXVlR050cnVGNFJpRDIwUmVQOWJzOXFWYW5QYnVjeHZYU3Nxbl9QUnRUMTZmenJqYXg1MDNTVllqeF9oUnFvQms2YXNucXZlajYtVGVRWktSc1hPQ0d5Q1BtbXQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;MyJoyOnline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;RNZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOTmpwdkVmX2luMVdEXy1zV3d1czdKV0ZMZkFyTG9BWk1sbWR4eHdLTlhGNms3R2RZaUhTd01ER2sxQ2dwNFUzR2JjU21xZ2w3SGw1RkhNc3k1aF9BR01rWnRQWk5va1JteEhKZGtNUE1qQWJLeDJVT281dGJpbndFRTUtLXdGTWF4UWp5WG1BMlB0SHdSQ2lidnVzNDFxWXl0?oc=5&quot;&gt;1029 Hot Tomato&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WDBJ7&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euromaidan Press&lt;/a&gt